   "en": "Koisuru 2DK, Ayakashi Zensai Tsuki."
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "恋する２DK、あやかし前妻憑き。"
   },
   {
    "en": "For Rent: A Loving 2DK Apartment, Ex-Wife Haunting Included"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "After being cheated on by her fiancé and being driven out of her home, Ookami Tsukasa realizes that romance is a trauma for her now. Loveless, homeless, and drowning herself in alcohol daily, she moves to a run-down apartment and meets the neighborhood heartthrob Isato Haruyuki. Could this be a sign of romance to come...!? Unfortunately, she ends up being haunted by Isato’s ex-wife!",
   "ja": "「もう男という生き物が信じられない…」\n\n婚約者に浮気された挙句家を追い出され、恋愛にトラウマを抱える限界OL・大上つかさ。恋人も家も失いヤケ酒に溺れる日々の中、引っ越してきたボロアパートで近所でも有名なイケメン・伊里 春幸に出会う。新たな恋の予感…!? だが、このアパートには伊里の“前妻”がとり憑いているようで――!?"
  },
